>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TEST-DATES.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "appointment-status.cpy".
COPY "appointment-date-params.cpy".
01 TEST-OP                 PIC X(12).
01 TEST-STATUS             PIC 9(3).
01 FAILURES                PIC 9 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE "VALIDATE" TO TEST-OP
    MOVE 20240229 TO ADP-INPUT-DATE PERFORM CALL-DATES
    IF TEST-STATUS NOT = APPT-OK ADD 1 TO FAILURES DISPLAY "FAIL leap day" END-IF
    MOVE 20230229 TO ADP-INPUT-DATE PERFORM CALL-DATES
    IF TEST-STATUS = APPT-OK ADD 1 TO FAILURES DISPLAY "FAIL invalid leap day" END-IF
    MOVE 20241301 TO ADP-INPUT-DATE PERFORM CALL-DATES
    IF TEST-STATUS = APPT-OK ADD 1 TO FAILURES DISPLAY "FAIL invalid month" END-IF
    MOVE "ISO" TO TEST-OP MOVE 20210101 TO ADP-INPUT-DATE PERFORM CALL-DATES
    IF ADP-ISO-YEAR NOT = 2020 OR ADP-ISO-WEEK NOT = 53
      ADD 1 TO FAILURES DISPLAY "FAIL ISO year boundary" END-IF
    MOVE 20240101 TO ADP-INPUT-DATE PERFORM CALL-DATES
    IF ADP-ISO-YEAR NOT = 2024 OR ADP-ISO-WEEK NOT = 1
      ADD 1 TO FAILURES DISPLAY "FAIL ISO week one" END-IF
    DISPLAY "date tests failures=" FAILURES
    MOVE FAILURES TO RETURN-CODE GOBACK.
CALL-DATES.
    CALL "APPOINTMENT-DATES" USING TEST-OP APPOINTMENT-DATE-PARAMS TEST-STATUS.
END PROGRAM TEST-DATES.
